			<div class="content" id="post-content-3844995">
									

<p>Alright reposting this. Have made a bunch of tweaks and changes to it to hopefully resolve a few issues and unintentional relations to other things. If the core idea wasn't something you liked, this probably won't change your mind, but who knows.</p>
<p>This is for DrMagnus' birthday contest.</p>
<p>Thanks to Rimple, stairfallinstitute, Lixerf, drblackbox, weryillium, djkaktus and DrBleep for reading the draft.</p>
<p>A note on the object class: The original version of this article was Archon class, which was defined in <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/i-h-p-proposal" target="_blank">ihp's proposal</a>. I was developing a very similar original object class for this while writing it, but when ihp's proposal was posted shortly before the original version of this, I decided to go with Archon instead.</p>
<p>Image is from here <a href="https://pxhere.com/en/photo/142008">https://pxhere.com/en/photo/142008</a></p>
<p><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/mortos-author-page" target="_blank">More of my stuff here.</a></p>

